{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2020-11-19 12:00:00', 'title': 'WITH MANY STILL SHELTERING AT HOME DURING THE PANDEMIC, PG&E KEEPING CUSTOMERS SAFE AND WARM WITH FREE ANNUAL GAS SAFETY CHECKS', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WITH WINTER AND COLDER TEMPERATURES RIGHT AROUND THE CORNER AND THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC ENDURING, PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY (PG&E) IS REMINDING CUSTOMERS TO CALL AND SCHEDULE A FREE IN-HOME SAFETY INSPECTION OF THEIR IN-HOME GAS APPLIANCES. DURING THE VISIT, PG&E WILL ALSO RELIGHT PILOT LIGHTS FOR CUSTOMERS WHO HAVE HEATERS OR OTHER APPLIANCES THAT HAVE BEEN TURNED OFF DURING WARMER MONTHS. INSPECTIONS HELP ENSURE THAT GAS APPLIANCES—INCLUDING WATER'}